### CREAR dato (SIMPLE)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/temperatureData
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sondaName": "Sonda-Madrid-01",
  "value": 25.5,
  "dateMedition": "2026-01-29T10:00:00Z",
  "hourMedition": "10:00"
}

###

###

### 2. OBTENER TODOS los datos (sin autenticación)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/temperatureData

###

### 3. ACTUALIZAR dato (cambiar ID y token)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/temperatureData/XXXXXXXXXX
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer TU_TOKEN_AQUI

{
  "value": 30.0
}

###

### 4. ELIMINAR dato (cambiar ID y token)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/temperatureData/XXXXXXXXXX
Authorization: Bearer TU_TOKEN_AQUI

###